    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Trigger </strong>You are using a talisman or similar magical consumable such as a fulu, or a permanent item that has an activate effect that recharges daily.</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Loupain of Meerhafen have a long history of taking advantage of magical items. With their ingenuity and cunning, they are able to squeeze out every bit of magic to make the most of these items. You can roll a Hard Crafting check at a DC that matches the item’s level. On a success, you don’t expend the charge or consume the item.</span></p>"
